,"updated_at":"2026-04-19T06:56:27Z","closed_at":"2026-04-10T15:38:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117726","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117726.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117726.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-10T15:38:25Z"},"body":"This is big PR which implements shader previews for Godot text shaders.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2269\" height=\"1740\" alt=\"изображение\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9ace03b-6690-44f5-8361-c937f5a3d059\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1844\" height=\"1619\" alt=\"изображение\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ef168e9-b953-480f-bbd1-809968ad1c5f\" />\r\n\r\nI mostly adapted a code from a https://github.com/cashew-olddew/godot-shader-previewer addon (and transformed it to C++).\r\n\r\nTest shader on screenshot:\r\n```gdshader\r\nshader_type canvas_item;\r\n\r\nuniform sampler2D tex;\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\tvec3 v = texture(tex, UV).rgb;\r\n\tvec2 v2 = vec2(sin(v.x), cos(v.y));\r\n\tvec3 v3 = vec3(0, 0.25, 0.5);\r\n\tvec2 v4 = UV;\r\n\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14373","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizat